// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2235401575" "Hey, {VillainName}, we got trouble. A Cage Consortium truck was hijacked! By Scrapyarders! Those little trouble-makers never learn. Worst thing is, that truck was carrying an arms shipment over to the Consortium guards in the Pit. If we don't get it back, Cage's men are going to be gunned down -- with their own guns! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to recover Cage's property and make sure the Scrapyarders regret taking it.</a> Get it?"
// AcceptString :
"P3566820057" "Recover Cage's stolen arms"
// SendOffString :
"P2823971219" "People like the Scrapyarders got to be smacked down and smacked down hard. The shipment was ambushed in the Pit, so start there."

