// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Shipment 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P322758095" "Cage Consortium shipment"
// DetailString :
"P45236889" "This large shipment you recovered from the Crush is badly needed by Kirk Cage's prodigal daughter, Crash Cage. No one's bothered to tell you what's inside it yet. You only know that it stinks."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P119004971" "A friend of mine is asking for help. Well, she's not a friend, exactly. In fact, she's sort of an enemy. Crash Cage, Kirk Cage's daughter. She won't have anything to do with her old man. I don't understand it, but, well, I still want to help her if I can. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Can you go see what Crash wants?</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P1110582702" "See what Crash wants"
// SendOffString :
"P1317848792" "Lately Crash has been involved with the Circle of Thorns. I don't approve, exactly, but if she's in trouble, I hope we can help her."
// TaskTitle :
"P4129905422" "Retrieve Crash's Shipment"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_Dubrowksi_Compound5_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3624978810" "Talk to Crash Cage"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1935102984" "Crash is still waiting on you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2612016586" "I'm glad you could come, {VillainName}. Vince is a good friend, even if he is a little too slow to see my dad's true colors. Anyway, I'm in a bit of a bind. A shipment destined for one of my friends got delivered to the Crush instead. That's a problem. My friends know I've still got connections in Cage: namely, Vince. So they say I have to make sure that shipment gets recovered. Or else. Can you help me out? Vince wouldn't want to see anything happen to me; he'll pay you well. <br><br>Oh, there's one more little thing. Arachnos is interested in the shipment, too. You may have to fight a few of their operatives."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_Dubrowksi_Compound5_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1326271421" "Retrieve the shipment"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3991979629" "Crash needs your help! I can't let anything happen to her!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P925053381" "It seems Arachnos is indeed interested in the shipment. And perhaps someone else as well."

