"P2976774651" "So Crash is all right? Whew. That's a load off my mind, {VillainName}. Crash is... well, she's special. I think so, anyway. I never said anything; she's the boss' daughter, and disloyal besides. But I'm glad she'll be ok."
// RandomFameString :
"P2966221317" "I hear {VillainName} knows how to handle those Slag Golems!"
